  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feminist Nexus Research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this research is to support the operationalisation of the humanitarian/peace/development nexus, and to demonstrate why local women led interventions are not only the right way to work but also evidencing that taking this approach produces higher quality programming, policy and impact.</narrative>
  </description>
